# V08 Crown Light v47

User correction: preserve the liked v08 silhouette; brighten the cloud crown color rather than smoothing coverage or redesigning the interior.

Source: `../RadialCrisp_v08/T_CloudLook_RadialCrisp_v08.png`.

- Original v08 alpha and G density are byte-identical (zero differences).
- R brightens only where radial coverage probes identify center-facing crowns. No pixels were darkened; 2,320,921 pixels brightened.
- B follows the change in the existing shade-derived 4s(1-s) term.
- No alpha blur, erosion, dilation, or silhouette regeneration.
- Packed texture imported into Unreal's Altitude/Rejected folder as `T_CloudLook_V08CrownLight_v47`.
- Source processing: `tmp/AnimeCloud360_Blender/pack_v47.ps1`.

The texture is saved. Live actor application is verified through both CloudBasis material parameters; the level is not saved. In-editor appearance still needs user review.
